For once I have a good character going; Kari the elven wizard. She got
Magicbane at her very first sacrifice, found plenty of good stuff
(several BoH, AoLS, lots of /=?!), two altars in the main dungeon, and
stubled onto several bones levels.

One of them was the Rogue level, and it turned out the dead hero was a
mummy carrying both Werebane and Stormbringer.

My only sacrifice gift so far has been that Magicbane (and Trollsbane,
which I don't use).  The problem now is: do I need to get crowned to
get any skill at all with Stormbringer?  And what about Werebane?

Also, if I cannot enhance those skills, should I go for some other
weapons, like Frost Brand?  I don't know how much skill matters for
otherwise high-level characters; I have only noticed how crucial it is
early in the game and for things like dagger throwing.

